# Scavenger picking over the gate dead. Buys junk, sells water. Tags quest: wants the tag too.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (He doesn't stop sorting.) Boots are worth more than rings. People forget that. Buying or selling?
# >>> pack f
#
o_text: You have a chrome bike tank. I'll buy it. (100)
o_id: mott_buy_tank
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(old_harley)') && HasItem('gold', 100) && !HasItem('harley_tank') && !HasFlag('mott_tank_sold')
o_goto: MottTank
# <<< pack f
#
o_text: (Sell junk.) I have scrap for you.
o_id: mott_sell_junk
o_cond: HasItem('junk')
o_goto: SellJunk
#
o_text: (Buy water.) 20 sat.
o_id: mott_buy_water
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 20) && !HasFlag('mott_water_gone')
o_goto: BuyWater
#
o_text: You pick the dead clean?
o_id: mott_dead
o_goto: Dead
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: mott_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: SellJunk
npc: Fifteen for a piece. Don't tell me where it came from.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'junk', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 15)
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: mott_junk_back
o_goto: Default

name: BuyWater
npc: Clean, mostly.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 20)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'water_ration', 1)
effect: SetFlag('mott_water_gone')
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: mott_water_back
o_goto: Default

name: Dead
npc: The ones near the wall, the guards let me. The ones past the airlock, nobody goes. EBI tags got collected. Except one, the kid with the chain. Bring me that and I'll give you a hundred. Collectors pay more, but they ask questions.
#
o_text: (Give him the tag.) A hundred.
o_id: mott_buy_tag
o_cond: HasItem('burton_dog_tag')
o_goto: TagSold
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: mott_dead_back
o_goto: Default

name: TagSold
npc: (It vanishes into a coat pocket.) Pleasure.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'burton_dog_tag', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 60)
effect: SetFlag('tag_sold')
effect: SetFlag('tag_sold_mott')
#
o_text: That's sixty.
o_id: mott_tag_short
o_goto: Short

name: Short
npc: That's what I have. Life's hard at the wall.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Mind the mines past the pylons.
effect: EndConversation

# >>> pack f
name: MottTank
npc: Flames and all. Some fool carried it to the wall to sell for water.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 100)
effect: PlayerAddItem('harley_tank')
effect: SetFlag('mott_tank_sold')
effect: EndConversation
# <<< pack f
